{"id":"n76810-1-9","stage":3,"title":"직진 · 直行","scene":"说明与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n76810-1-9-1","ko":"그쪽으로 어떻게 가면 돼요?","zh":"去那边要怎么走呢？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"그쪽으로","meaning":"那里，那边","explanation":"그쪽：那里，那边；으로：表示方向、方式、手段、材料、身份或原因等关系。","readings":[{"term":"그쪽","audio":"/audio/bbb24e368e31fe1aff31.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17206","senseId":"2","lemma":"그쪽","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"어떻게","meaning":"怎么样","explanation":"어떻다：怎么样；게：使前面的动作或状态修饰后文，也用于 -게 되다、-게 하다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"어떻다","audio":"/audio/e0a8c114a77e081454d1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70482","senseId":"1","lemma":"어떻다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"가면","meaning":"走","explanation":"가다：走；면：表示条件或假设：“如果、若、……的话”。","readings":[{"term":"가다","audio":"/audio/233cb510410b09d69cdc.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27500","senseId":"13","lemma":"가다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"돼요?","meaning":"能，行","explanation":"되다：能，行；어요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"되다","audio":"/audio/91b4dc2748cba787dd6f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89858","senseId":"21","lemma":"되다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"bbb24e368e31fe1a","term":"그쪽","zh":"那里，那边","audio":"/audio/bbb24e368e31fe1aff31.mp3","entryId":"17206","definition":"指代对话双方已知的地方或方向。","pronunciation":["그쪽"]},{"id":"e0a8c114a77e0814","term":"어떻다","zh":"怎么样","audio":"/audio/e0a8c114a77e081454d1.mp3","entryId":"70482","definition":"想法、感觉、状态或境况等成为什么状况。","pronunciation":["어떠타"]},{"id":"233cb510410b09d6","term":"가다","zh":"走","audio":"/audio/233cb510410b09d69cdc.mp3","entryId":"27500","definition":"通过某种途径移动。","pronunciation":["가다"]},{"id":"91b4dc2748cba787","term":"되다","zh":"能，行","audio":"/audio/91b4dc2748cba787dd6f.mp3","entryId":"89858","definition":"某个事情可行或被允许。","pronunciation":["되다","뒈다"]}],"audio":"/audio/be0b0f35f52535d35943.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n76810-1-9-2","ko":"역에서 나오셔서 일 분 정도 곧바로 직진으로 가면 저희 건물이 보입니다.","zh":"从车站出来后，直接笔直走大约一分钟，就能看到我们的大楼了。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"역에서","meaning":"驿，站","explanation":"역：驿，站；에서：格助词，表示动作发生的地点或出发点。","readings":[{"term":"역","audio":"/audio/0d8513f4ca123f336cd9.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70724","senseId":"1","lemma":"역","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"나오셔서","meaning":"出，出来","explanation":"나오다：出，出来；시：主语敬语，尊敬动作或状态的主体。；어서：连接原因与结果，或前后相接的动作。","readings":[{"term":"나오다","audio":"/audio/038a8038eb817ffef26e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62233","senseId":"1","lemma":"나오다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"일","meaning":"事","explanation":"일：事","readings":[{"term":"일","audio":"/audio/dfc76879e2f5c3ead091.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"91895","senseId":"7","lemma":"일","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"분","meaning":"分，分钟","explanation":"분：分，分钟","readings":[{"term":"분","audio":"/audio/ca4a187881dbf529d05e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70891","senseId":"1","lemma":"분","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"정도","meaning":"左右","explanation":"정도：左右","readings":[{"term":"정도","audio":"/audio/1a771e4b7f99176bc0a6.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70876","senseId":"3","lemma":"정도","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"곧바로","meaning":"直，一直","explanation":"곧바로：直，一直","readings":[{"term":"곧바로","audio":"/audio/7cfe117c3a6d5cc2ca08.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"25545","senseId":"2","lemma":"곧바로","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"직진으로","meaning":"直行","explanation":"직진：直行；으로：表示方向、方式、手段、材料、身份或原因等关系。","readings":[{"term":"직진","audio":"/audio/2c3ccd3b907353b1a90d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"76810","senseId":"1","lemma":"직진","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"가면","meaning":"走","explanation":"가다：走；면：表示条件或假设：“如果、若、……的话”。","readings":[{"term":"가다","audio":"/audio/233cb510410b09d69cdc.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27500","senseId":"13","lemma":"가다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"저희","meaning":"我们","explanation":"저희：我们","readings":[{"term":"저희","audio":"/audio/75d5f0d25c8827a5d019.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71231","senseId":"2","lemma":"저희","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"건물이","meaning":"建筑，建筑物","explanation":"건물：建筑，建筑物；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"건물","audio":"/audio/51a9489f74ea88e7bf4d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"28029","senseId":"1","lemma":"건물","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"보입니다.","meaning":"可见，看得到","explanation":"보이다：可见，看得到；ㅂ니다：正式礼貌的陈述句末。","readings":[{"term":"보이다","audio":"/audio/da6f27438e6f345c1e87.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62091","senseId":"3","lemma":"보이다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"0d8513f4ca123f33","term":"역","zh":"驿，站","audio":"/audio/0d8513f4ca123f336cd9.mp3","entryId":"70724","definition":"列车出发到达的地方。","pronunciation":["역"]},{"id":"038a8038eb817ffe","term":"나오다","zh":"出，出来","audio":"/audio/038a8038eb817ffef26e.mp3","entryId":"62233","definition":"从里面到外面。","pronunciation":["나오다"]},{"id":"dfc76879e2f5c3ea","term":"일","zh":"事","audio":"/audio/dfc76879e2f5c3ead091.mp3","entryId":"91895","definition":"过去经历的经验。","pronunciation":["일ː"]},{"id":"ca4a187881dbf529","term":"분","zh":"分，分钟","audio":"/audio/ca4a187881dbf529d05e.mp3","entryId":"70891","definition":"计时单位，表示一个小时的六十分之一。","pronunciation":["분"]},{"id":"1a771e4b7f99176b","term":"정도","zh":"左右","audio":"/audio/1a771e4b7f99176bc0a6.mp3","entryId":"70876","definition":"那样的分量或水准。","pronunciation":["정도"]},{"id":"7cfe117c3a6d5cc2","term":"곧바로","zh":"直，一直","audio":"/audio/7cfe117c3a6d5cc2ca08.mp3","entryId":"25545","definition":"不拐弯的，顺着一个方向。","pronunciation":["곧빠로"]},{"id":"2c3ccd3b907353b1","term":"직진","zh":"直行","audio":"/audio/2c3ccd3b907353b1a90d.mp3","entryId":"76810","definition":"径直前行。","pronunciation":["직찐"]},{"id":"233cb510410b09d6","term":"가다","zh":"走","audio":"/audio/233cb510410b09d69cdc.mp3","entryId":"27500","definition":"通过某种途径移动。","pronunciation":["가다"]},{"id":"75d5f0d25c8827a5","term":"저